    "Calendar, Temporale, Sanctorale, Commons, local-use instruction, episcopal arms, modern library card (p. 1) and colophon (p. 656)",
    "Woodcut initial ornament, Gothic display type sizes, ink colour, gathering signature mark (pp at p. 350 foot) and diplomatic glyph variants"
